tras/d827f90875e025062b723ebcc511f554.mp4?t=1740781983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Murdering doe-eyed bunny beasts isn't enough to win! Somehow, you'll need to get enough &quot;Gods' Wine&quot; to close the flaming portals that keep sending out more opponents.<br><br>Sometimes the rabbits will drop this celestial nectar, and sometimes a more economic approach is required.<br><br>If you've got a little chemist inside you somewhere, perhaps you'd prefer making your own divine kombucha.<br>Good thing every critter killed is a pi\u00f1ata of goo-covered treasure.",
